sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Producer
    participant M as Mutex
    participant Buf as Buffer
    participant C as Consumer
    P->>M: lock
    alt buffer full
        P->>P: wait on notFull, releasing the lock
        Note over P,M: wait releases the mutex — otherwise the consumer can never drain it
    end
    P->>Buf: push
    P->>C: signal notEmpty
    P->>M: unlock
    C->>M: lock
    alt buffer empty
        C->>C: wait on notEmpty
    end
    C->>Buf: pop
    C->>P: signal notFull
    C->>M: unlock
    Note over P,C: always re-check the predicate in a while loop — wakeups can be spurious
